= Energy conversion — Simple =

'''Energy conversion''' means changing energy from one form to another.

A solar panel changes some sunlight into electricity. A fan uses electrical energy to move air, and it also warms up. A bicycle's brakes change motion energy into heat.

Energy is not destroyed during conversion. However, not all the energy put into a machine necessarily becomes the useful result you wanted. [[Energy efficiency|Energy efficiency]] describes how much of the input becomes the chosen useful output.

